* Build the minimal meso-erythritol/threitol dual-topology ligand
*

bomblev -2

open read card unit 10 name ../../../../toppar/top_all36_cgenff.rtf
read rtf card unit 10
open read card unit 20 name ../../../../toppar/par_all36_cgenff.prm
read para card unit 20 flex

read rtf append card name build/core.rtf
read param flex append card name build/full_ligand.prm
read rtf append card name build/site1_sub1_pres.rtf
read rtf append card name build/site1_sub2_pres.rtf

read sequ pdb name build/core.pdb
generate LIG setup
read coor pdb resid name build/core.pdb

patch p1_1 LIG 1 setup
read coor pdb resid name build/site1_sub1_frag.pdb
ic param
ic build

patch p1_2 LIG 1 setup
read coor pdb resid name build/site1_sub2_frag.pdb
ic param
ic build

auto angle dihe

define meso select atom LIG 1 O015 .or. atom LIG 1 H016 .or. -
                   atom LIG 1 H017 .or. atom LIG 1 C018 end
define threo select atom LIG 1 O019 .or. atom LIG 1 H020 .or. -
                    atom LIG 1 H021 .or. atom LIG 1 C022 end

! Remove automatically generated bonded terms spanning both alternatives.
dele connectivity sele meso show end sele threo show end

print coor sele .not. init end
write psf card name hybrid.psf
* meso-erythritol/threitol dual topology
*
write coor pdb card name hybrid.pdb
* meso-erythritol/threitol dual-topology coordinates
*
write coor card name hybrid.crd
* meso-erythritol/threitol dual-topology coordinates
*

stop
